WEBVTT

01:06:57.753 --> 01:07:00.179
CA: David Brooks
is a "New York Times" columnist

01:07:00.203 --> 01:07:01.699
and the author of four books,

01:07:01.723 --> 01:07:05.304
including "The Second Mountain:
The Quest for a Moral Life."

01:07:05.328 --> 01:07:09.473
To listen to David’s
Ted Talks, visit TED.com

01:07:09.846 --> 01:07:11.846
(Music)

01:07:14.139 --> 01:07:17.569
This week’s show
was produced by Megan Tan.

01:07:17.593 --> 01:07:20.281
Our production manager
is Roxanne Hai Lash.

01:07:20.305 --> 01:07:22.116
Our mix engineer, David Herman.

01:07:22.140 --> 01:07:25.445
Our theme music
is by Allison Leyton-Brown.

01:07:25.469 --> 01:07:28.037
Special thanks to
my colleague Michelle Quint.

01:07:29.084 --> 01:07:32.868
If you like this show, please share it
with someone else who is curious